{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!This game contains visual effects that may cause dizziness, disorientation, or seizures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller supported for gameplay. A mouse and keyboard are required for the interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a basketball star, now washed-up, you\u2019ve got one last shot to prove you\u2019re the GOAT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/44ae1cd40cdef470960fcbac4233f908.poster.avif?t=1757500082\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/44ae1cd40cdef470960fcbac4233f908.webm?t=1757500082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/44ae1cd40cdef470960fcbac4233f908.mp4?t=1757500082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: climb as high as humanly possible using nothing but your athleticism, precision jumping, and your trusty basketball \u2013 which can teleport you wherever it lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/f759d9e5ce03333a6159f1db8f9b720a.poster.avif?t=1757500082\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/f759d9e5ce03333a6159f1db8f9b720a.webm?t=1757500082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/f759d9e5ce03333a6159f1db8f9b720a.mp4?t=1757500082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a punishing vertical platformer where one mistake can undo minutes (or even hours) of progress, but every jump is another chance to rise higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/9a31dd9e6fcee78aa0b67ebebe6e3ae7.avif?t=1757500082\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There <strong>are checkpoints</strong>, but you\u2019ll have to earn them. Overcome every obstacle in your path and shoot for the stars\u2014because you never know\u2026 you just might make it all the way to the moon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872200?t=1757500082","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872200?t=1757500082","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/b33d9c31996ebc006ce91f675b0b858d2acd6f5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757500082","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/b33d9c31996ebc006ce91f675b0b858d2acd6f5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757500082","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!This game contains visual effects that may cause dizziness, disorientation, or seizures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller supported for gameplay. A mouse and keyboard are required for the interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a basketball star, now washed-up, you\u2019ve got one last shot to prove 